 fails.\";","+    let why = \"An agent in .agents/agents/ reads a step's change when it finishes. If it fails the change, the step fails.\";","     column![help(why), fields].spacing(6).into()"," }"," ","-/// A picker for a constraint scoped to other steps, to apply here too.","-pub(super) fn elsewhere_form<'a>(rules: &Rules, at: &At) -> Element<'a, Msg> {","-    let elsewhere: Vec<Choice> = rules","-        .constraints","-        .iter()","-        .filter(|c| !c.steps.is_empty() && !c.steps.iter().any(|s| s == at.step))","-        .map(|c| Choice::new(&c.id, &c.rule))","-        .collect();","-    if elsewhere.is_empty() {","-        return help(\"No constraint applies only at other steps.\");","-    }","-    let pick = pick_list(elsewhere, None::<Choice>, |c| Msg::Scope(c.id, true))","-        .placeholder(\"Pick a constraint that applies at other steps\")","-        .text_size(13)","-        .style(theme::select)","-        .width(Fill);","-    column![","-        help(\"A constraint already scoped to other steps, applied here too.\"),","-        pick","-    ]","-    .spacing(6)","-    .into()","-}","-"," /// The rows of `list`, enforced first, narrowed to the filter."," pub(super) fn rows<'a>(","     rules: &Rules,"]},{"oldStart":232,"oldLines":10,"newStart":166,"newLines":7,"lines":["     at: &At,","     editable: bool,"," ) -> Vec<Element<'a, Msg>> {","-    let mut shown: Vec<&ConstraintView> = list","-        .into_iter()","-        .filter(|c| fits(c, &rules.filter))","-        .collect();","+    let mut shown: Vec<&ConstraintView> = list.into_iter().filter(|c| fits(c, &rules.filter)).collect();","     shown.sort_by_key(|c| rung(c).0);","     shown.into_iter().map(|c| line(c, at, editable)).collect()"," }"]},{"oldStart":254,"oldLines":14,"newStart":185,"newLines":9,"lines":["         };","         assert_eq!(kind(&hook), \"Hook\");","         assert!(fits(&hook, \"hook ENFORCED\"));","-        assert!(fits(&hook, \"\"));","         assert!(!fits(&hook, \"reviewer\"));","-        assert_eq!(kind(&ConstraintView::default()), \"Rule\");","         assert_eq!(layer(&hook), \"harness\", \"a hook binds calls\");","-        let reviewer = ConstraintView {","-            reviewer: \"security\".into(),","-            ..ConstraintView::default()","-        };","+        let reviewer = ConstraintView { reviewer: \"security\".into(), ..ConstraintView::default() };","         assert_eq!(layer(&reviewer), \"factory\", \"a reviewer reads the work\");","     }"," }"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/mod.rs","hunks":[{"oldStart":421,"oldLines":6,"newStart":421,"newLines":27,"lines":["         .into()"," }"," ","+/// An item's setting at the level shown: Inherit (with what it inherits),","+/// On or Off. Every workflow inherits nothing, so it shows On and Off.","+fn scope_switch<'a>(item: Item, scopes: &[String], at: &At, editable: bool) -> Element<'a, Msg> {","+    let (own, inherited) = scope::at(scopes, at.scope);","+    let now = own.unwrap_or(inherited);","+    let set = |label: String, chosen: bool, to: &str| {","+        let msg = (editable && !chosen).then(|| Msg::SetScope(item.clone(), to.into()));","+        choice(label, chosen, msg)","+    };","+    let word = if inherited { \"on\" } else { \"off\" };","+    let mut switch = iced::widget::row![].spacing(2);","+    if !at.is_every() {","+        switch = switch.push(set(format!(\"Inherit · {word}\"), own.is_none(), \"inherit\"));","+    }","+    let every = at.is_every() || own.is_some();","+    switch","+        .push(set(\"On\".into(), every && now, \"on\"))","+        .push(set(\"Off\".into(), every && !now, \"off\"))","+        .into()","+}","+"," /// A line of muted help."," fn help<'a>(words: impl Into<String>) -> Element<'a, Msg> {","     text(words.into()).size(12).color(theme::MUTED).into()"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/constraints