{"parentUuid":"984be68d-d3e5-42b2-ba3c-38bd26d47d28","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyQXu7dpVzYDwxZNKYhg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vr4CvNzwq8wvC4BBcHw4MW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold='''- The Add bar adds an item on at the level it is on.\n'''\nnew='''- The Add bar adds an item on at the level it is on.\n\nDone 2026-11-12. Live, at Bug fix \"Keep shell use small\" went Off, as\n`* !bug-fix`; Bug fix's build step then showed it as \"Inherit · off\", and\nOn there gave `* !bug-fix bug-fix/build`. At All workflows the canvas\nhides and each item shows On | Off, with Remove. A \"here\" label sets the\nscope switch apart from the rung switch beside it.\n'''\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add PLAN.md crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/capabilities.rs crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/constraints.rs crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/layers.rs crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/mod.rs crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/scope.rs crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/workflows.rs && git commit -q -m \"G2: rules at three levels on the Workflows page\n\nA level bar reads All workflows › the workflow › the step. Picking a step\nopens its level, the canvas background opens the workflow's, and All\nworkflows hides the canvas. Each level shows the same rules by layer;\nevery constraint and grant has its rung and an Inherit | On | Off switch\nthat says what it inherits, labeled \\\"here\\\". What the Add bar adds is on\nat the level it is on. Remove, which deletes an item everywhere, shows\nonly at All workflows.\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Record G2 and commit"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1295,"ca